    "title": "Northern lights seen in the skies across Mid-Michigan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n2 hours ago\nLANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — As the northern lights illuminate the night sky across Mid-Michigan, some 6 News viewers have shared their pictures of the phenomenon!\nThe lights, seen in Jackson. (Janice Beach) The lights visible from Dewitt. (Lauren Ledesma) The northern lights in Hanover. (Genevieve Huntley) The aurora could be seen well with a camera’s long exposure, but a little dimmer with the naked eye. If you took pictures or video of the Northern Lights, please share them below or through our Pics on 6 page .\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WLNS 6 News.\n2",
